---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vessel Seizures — HormuzTracker.tech" description="Track vessel seizures and detentions in the Strait of Hormuz crisis. Tit-for-tat seizure monitor." path="/seizures">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-6" id="seizures-page">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Vessel Seizure Tracker</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Tit-for-tat seizure log during the Hormuz crisis</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Summary -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3" id="seizure-stats">
      <div class="glass-card p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-crisis-red" id="total-seizures">--</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Total Incidents</div>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-crisis-orange" id="held-vessels">--</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Currently Held</div>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-crisis-blue" id="iran-seizures">--</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Iran (IRGC)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card p-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-black text-crisis-green" id="us-uk-seizures">--</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">US/UK Retaliatory</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Seizure Table -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Seizure Log</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-700/50">
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Date</th>
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Entity</th>
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Vessel</th>
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Flag</th>
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Type</th>
              <th class="text-center py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="seizure-table"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Analysis -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Seizure Pattern Analysis</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-sm max-w-none">
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">The vessel seizure pattern during the Hormuz crisis follows a clear tit-for-tat escalation model. Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) initiated seizures on March 20, 2026, targeting commercial vessels transiting international waters near the strait. The initial targets were Marshall Islands and Liberia-flagged tankers — vessels with minimal state backing that Iran assessed would not trigger a military response. The strategy was calibrated to raise pressure without crossing the threshold into overt warfare.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-3">The US and UK responses came in April, with targeted detentions of Iranian-flagged cargo vessels. These retaliatory seizures were carefully chosen to demonstrate capability while maintaining proportionality. However, Iran's subsequent seizure of a UK-flagged tanker (MV Stena Impero II) and a Hong Kong-flagged container ship marked a significant escalation, broadening the scope beyond Gulf states to include NATO-aligned and Chinese-interest vessels. The seizure of an LNG carrier (MV Brave Explorer) in late April represented a new threshold, as LNG carriers are among the most valuable and strategically significant vessels in global trade, each carrying cargo worth $50-100 million.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const API = 'https://hormuz-api.tradesapi.workers.dev';
    async function loadSeizures() {
      try {
        const seizures = await fetch(`${API}/api/seizures`).then(r => r.json());
        const held = seizures.filter(s => s.status === 'Held').length;
        const iranCount = seizures.filter(s => s.entity.includes('Iran')).length;
        const usUkCount = seizures.filter(s => s.entity.includes('US') || s.entity.includes('UK')).length;

        document.getElementById('total-seizures').textContent = seizures.length;
        document.getElementById('held-vessels').textContent = held;
        document.getElementById('iran-seizures').textContent = iranCount;
        document.getElementById('us-uk-seizures').textContent = usUkCount;

        document.getElementById('seizure-table').innerHTML = seizures.map(s => {
          const statusClass = s.status === 'Held' ? 'bg-crisis-red/20 text-crisis-red' : 'bg-crisis-green/20 text-crisis-green';
          return `<tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50">
            <td class="py-2 text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs">${s.date}</td>
            <td class="py-2 text-white text-xs">${s.entity}</td>
            <td class="py-2 text-white font-medium text-xs">${s.vessel}</td>
            <td class="py-2 text-slate-400 text-xs">${s.flag}</td>
            <td class="py-2 text-slate-400 text-xs">${s.type}</td>
            <td class="py-2 text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold ${statusClass}">${s.status}</span></td>
          </tr>`;
        }).join('');
      } catch (e) { console.error('Seizures load failed:', e); }
    }
    loadSeizures();
  </script>
</Layout>
